1
00:00:00,457 --> 00:00:02,427
(Sheldon:)Oh. Well, the real surprise is

2
00:00:02,426 --> 00:00:05,006
(Sheldon:)how surprised you are
that I'm great at surprises.

3
00:00:05,011 --> 00:00:06,961
(Amy:)Well, that's not a
surprise at all.

4
00:00:06,963 --> 00:00:09,183
(Amy:)I mean, if I knew you
were good at surprises,

5
00:00:09,182 --> 00:00:10,382
(Amy:)I would have
expected the surprise,

6
00:00:10,383 --> 00:00:11,763
and therefore not
have been surprised.

7
00:00:11,768 --> 00:00:13,048
But as it is,
I didn't know,

8
00:00:13,053 --> 00:00:16,183
and therefore my surprise
should be unsurprising.

9
00:00:16,189 --> 00:00:19,139
(Sheldon:)Don't get me all randy.
Guests are on the way.

10
00:00:23,313 --> 00:00:24,943
(Leonard:)Hi.

11
00:00:24,948 --> 00:00:26,478
(Bernadette:)Hey, where you been?

12
00:00:26,483 --> 00:00:28,813
(Howard:)Oh, we went and did a little
shopping for the baby.

13
00:00:28,819 --> 00:00:30,699
(Raj:)Wait till you see
the crib we found.

14
00:00:30,704 --> 00:00:32,824
(Bernadette:)You bought a crib without me?

15
00:00:32,823 --> 00:00:34,493
(Howard:)You're gonna love it.
Yeah.

16
00:00:34,491 --> 00:00:35,991
(Raj:)It's the highest rated one
on the market.

17
00:00:35,992 --> 00:00:37,322
(Raj:)I wouldn't even
call it a crib.

18
00:00:37,327 --> 00:00:40,747
(Raj:)I'd call it a Fortress
of Solitude for babies.

19
00:00:40,747 --> 00:00:43,247
(Bernadette:)Sounds expensive.

20
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:44,920
(Howard:)Okay, well,
I may have gone

21
00:00:44,918 --> 00:00:48,088
(Howard:)a bit overboard, but you can't
put a price on safety.

22
00:00:48,088 --> 00:00:51,508
(Raj:)Though if you did, it's more
zeroes than you're expecting.

23
00:00:52,509 --> 00:00:54,089
(Howard:)But it's the safest crib
you can buy.

24
00:00:54,094 --> 00:00:56,094
(Howard:)And if you don't like it,
we can return it.

25
00:00:56,096 --> 00:00:58,016
(Sheldon:)Fine.
In our new minivan.

26
00:00:58,014 --> 00:01:00,184
(Howard:)Hey, what's for lunch?

